{
  "bodyHash": "Yqz1MR8c5u8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1425/853/title-png.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_35387524-87cb-4c95-90f1-2ac1ca2f2cea.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">内容</h2><p style=\"text-align:left\">此附加包为Alien Evo添加了Clockwork（Chronosapiens）作为新的变身形态。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">原型、OV、10K和UAF</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_a3a6949c-8563-408e-80c6-8df0917829ce.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_10e64346-a098-4794-9654-68137fb4c562.png\" alt=\"图像\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">与科技气泡融合</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_d30ae19e-4c56-4a12-87c0-2dae587074ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">获取方式</h2><p>在主世界区域寻找<strong>玛特鲁安特的时空兽</strong>。击败它们可获得<strong>时间钟零件</strong>并制作<strong>超时体DNA</strong>，从而解锁Clockwork形态。或者使用指令<code>/alienautoadd</code>。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_879bfca1-fef1-41de-848f-774822542a3b.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_cfc1f2af-e093-4197-b744-034f9a6babf2.png\" alt=\"图像\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_14763aa3-e0db-4215-ab61-5ccf5747a70e.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_73665f29-215c-43a1-ab36-76b43b5c197e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">能力展示</h2><p>Chronosapiens并非花哨的英雄，而是拥有极其复杂机制的形态。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_92ed5766-6053-4383-b893-6c30bda9f046.png\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_3dd4421b-4813-4622-8611-0de531b4e3fd.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">重要物品</h2><p>加尔文指南针：右键点击探测矿石（冷却4秒）。潜行右击可全球定位三个玛特鲁安特零件。加尔文电磁脉冲枪：用于发射电磁脉冲，提升区域内的生物受到的伤害并削弱Chronosapiens。使用欧米尼水晶充能。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_019f19ac-67fe-4b51-96e9-5193b3c2e7c7.png\" alt=\"图像\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_bfa4ab07-8e95-423d-8b2f-2fa4b85402bd.png\" alt=\"图像\"></p><p>超时体时间炸弹：击败玛特鲁安特获得。右键点击可设置程序，从当前时间线抹除目标生物。需时间钟钥匙充能。对玛特鲁安特无效。使用索托布罗效应倒流时间可将其带回。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_21350384-c2f9-42ff-92b1-5137402c2ae7.png\" alt=\"图像\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_fed5b0ab-8f18-4c04-9b07-820db38ab1b5.png\" alt=\"图像\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">最终BOSS玛特鲁安特</h2><p>玛特鲁安特钥匙、齿轮、六角体、第一部分和第二部分：这些零件散落在主世界各处。按顺序放置在祭坛上即可召唤玛特鲁安特。外骨骼颅骨和Subdora也在寻找这些零件。当玛特鲁安特爆炸时，零件和祭坛会随机重生。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_8648003d-6566-45f2-bcd2-83c9d4a2f127.png\" alt=\"图像\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_bf91b5f8-acda-46b7-9cb7-02760c97d0a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>使用指令<code>/chrono locate</code>可定位目标，点击坐标即可传送。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_fdd55f27-5b3f-49fd-8cd4-e3465f50a027.png\" alt=\"图像\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1376943/description_97e6ec8c-5f30-4891-83cc-65cb13890c8c.png\" alt=\"图像\"></p><hr>",
